              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2"> 
                  <div align="center"><b><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#840084"><u><font size="4" face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">REVISION 
                    OF VISA FEES</font></u></font></b></div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="5"> 
                  <div align="justify"><b>SINGAPORE HIGH COMMISION:</b></div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">With 
                  effect from 1 January 2007, the new Visa fees for Singapore 
                  High Commission would be Rs580/- per passport. This fees would 
                  be payable in cash. </font></td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2">&nbsp;</td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2"><b>ROYAL DANISH EMBASSY:</b></td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">With 
                  effect from 1 January 2007, the new Visa fees for The Royal 
                  Danish Embassy would be Rs3600/- per passport. This fees would 
                  be payable by Demand draft or pay order in favour of Royal Danish 
                  Embassy.</font></td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2">&nbsp;</td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2"><b>UK VFS:</b></td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">With 
                  effect from 1 January 2007, the new VFS Logistic Fee has been 
                  revised to Rs 565/-(Inclusive of Service Tax) per passport.</font></td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2">&nbsp;</td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2"><b>AUSTRALIAN HIGH COMMISION</b></td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">With 
                  effect from 1 January 2007 the new visa fees for the following 
                  visas are: <br>
                  <br>
                  Visitor/Tourist/Business Visa Fee: Rs 2700/- <br>
                  Long Term Business Visa Fee/Work Visa: Rs 7000/- <br>
                  Student Visa Fee: Rs 16,100/- <br>
                  Migration Visa Fee: Rs 50,200/- <br>
                  <br>
                  This fees would be payable by Demand draft in favour of "Australian 
                  High Commission " payable at New Delhi. </font></td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2">&nbsp;</td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2"><b>EMBASSY OF FINLAND</b></td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2"> 
                  <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">With effect 
                    from 5th january,2007 the new fees for the following visas 
                    are:</font></p>
                  <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">Business/Tourist 
                    Visa : Rs 3300/-<br>
                    Residence Permit/Work Permit Visa: Rs 10900/-<br>
                    Residence permit for Students and Minor(under 18 years) : 
                    Rs 3000/-<br>
                    Transfer of valid visa to new travel document : Rs 2500/-<br>
                    Transfer of valid residence permit to new travel document 
                    : Rs 1450/-</font></p>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td colspan="5" height="2">&nbsp;</td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2">
                  <hr>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2"> 
                  <div align="center"><b> <font size="4" color="#840084">PROTECTOR 
                    OF EMIGRANTS</font></b></div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan="5" height="2"> 
                  <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">With Effect 
                    from 28/12/06 POE would be required only for the following 
                    countries:<br>
                    <br>
                    Hong Kong<br>
                    Malaysia<br>
                    Thailand<br>
                    Taiwan<br>
                    Indonesia<br>
                    Gulf Countries (Exception-Iran and Israel)<br>
                    <br>
                    POE has been waived off for all the other countries as per 
                    the Notification(dated 28/12/06) by the Ministry of Overseas 
                    Indian Affairs.</font></p>
                </td>
              </tr>
